      Here is a picture of the composition <m>T\circ U</m> as a <q>machine</q> that first runs <m>U</m>, then takes its output and feeds it into <m>T</m>; there is a similar picture in <xref ref="subsec-matrix-trans-transformations" text="type-global"/>.
