            </p>
          </description>
          <instructions>
            <p>
              
            </p>
          </instructions>
        </interactive>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <caption>Illustration of the composition <m>U\circ T</m>.</caption>
        <interactive
            iframe="iframes/compose2d-if.html?mat2=1,0,1,1&amp;mat1=1,1,0,1&amp;closed&amp;vec=1,0&amp;names=U,T&amp;show1=on"
            width="90%"
